        <mxCell id="cap2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#3a3f55;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;For&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Closest to a production deployment: managed database and store, a stable hostname and no tunnel. Exercises cloud KEK, signing and presigned URLs end to end." vertex="1">
