        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cap3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#3a3f55;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Against&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Largest scope and cost: a server root with database, store, load balancer, DNS and certificate per batch. The server runs remotely, so its coverage needs its own collection. Slowest to provision and clean up." vertex="1">
